            "paragraph": "La Ni\u00f1a, which is generally characterised by anomalously low sea surface temperatures (SSTs) in the tropical central to eastern Pacific Ocean surrounded by anomalously high SSTs in the western Pacific Ocean, is a key climate driver of higher-than-normal springtime rainfall over northern and eastern Australia (e.g., Drosdowsky and Chambers 2001; Hendon et al. 2014; McBride and Nicholls 1983; McGregor et al. 2024; Risbey et al. 2009).",
